    {
      "id": 5,
      "name": "Coloc ",
      "description": "Colocalisation is set to 0.1 (0.1-1) as default and may be changed.\n\nWith these settings you will find the following groups:\nall spots: includes coloc and non-coloc spots\n- non colocalising ch1, ch2, ch3: spots only detected in the one respective channel\n- 2 channel coloc spots: e.g. ch1and 2 includes all spots that have channel 1 and 2 and also includes spots that might have ch3\n- 3 channel coloc spots: spots recognized in ch1, 2 and 3",
      "imageSource": "SCRATCHPAD",
